` | `dur=90.0417 s` (`2161`f H.264 + AAC 256k) | `I=-14.2 LUFS, TP=-1.6 dBFS`\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 14:22:40\",\"request_id\":\"9beec3eb-8481-46db-bf5b-d6f2cb5544b0\"},{\"seq\":21,\"agent\":\"ver\n<truncated 2515 bytes>\n(`-0.35 -\\u003e -6.5` end fade), DOF \\u0026 motion blur preserved.\\n\\n### 2. Stills \\u0026 Clay Visual Quality Metrics (PIL/NumPy)\\n- **Color Stills (`renders_v5/stills/`)**: All 26 fresh `1920x1080` stills (`shot_01_*.jpg`..`shot_26_*.jpg`) + labeled `contact_sheet.jpg` (`1920x1476`, `739 KB`) verified — balanced luminance (`MeanL = 73.6–123.4` trackside, `38.9–61.8` aerials), controlled highlight roll-off (`Clip% = 0.02%–3.08%`), smooth sky gradients (`0.05–1.13` on open sky), `S21_stowe_tele` completely clear (`MeanL = 89.4, Clip% = 0.53%`).\\n- **Clay Stills (`renders_v5/clay_stills/`)**: All 6 fresh `1920x1080` `clay_test_*.jpg` (`MeanL = 81.5–103.0`, `Clip% = 0.01%–2.47%`, down from `25.08%` in Round 1) + updated 26-shot `contact_sheet_clay.jpg` (`1920x1404`, `273 KB`) verified.\\n\\n### 3. Audio Synthesis \\u0026 Video Mux Verification (`ffprobe` + `volumedetect` + PCM Audit)\\n- `sfx_engine_90s.wav` (`17.29 MB`): `48 kHz` 16-bit 2ch PCM, `4,322,000` samples (`90.0417 s`), `0` clipped samples, `0` NaNs, smooth cut crossfades, peak `-1.50 dBFS`, mean `-18.0 dB`, clean `1.5 s` end fade (`tail_0.2s_rms = -38.6 dBFS`).\\n- `audio_v5_sfx_mix_90s.m4a` (`2.94 MB`): AAC `48 kHz` 2ch, `90.0417 s`, `mean = -16.2 dB`, `max = -1.6 dB` (`\\u003c= -1.0 dBFS`).\\n- `f1_silverstone_clay_silent.mp4` (`33.15 MB`) \\u0026 `f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4` (`35.34 MB`): H.264 `1920x1080` @ `24 fps`, `2,161` frames (`90.0417 s`), `max = -1.3 dB`.\\n- `f1_silverstone_clay_sfx_1080p.mp4` (`36.11 MB`) \\u0026 `f1_silverstone_lap_sfx_1080p.mp4` (`65.02 MB`): H.264 `1920x1080` @ `24 fps`, `2,161` frames (`90.0417 s`) + AAC `48 kHz` 2ch (`mean = -16.2 dB, max = -1.6 dB`).\\n\\n### 4. Documentation Consistency\\n- `README.md`, `LATEST/README.txt`, and `docs/README