`@anim` -\\u003e `@sfx`!\\n3) Once Iteration 2 (or 3) passes 10/10 cinema-grade QA on all 26 stills \\u0026 3 clips, tag `@coordinator` with `READY_FOR_FULL_MASTER_RENDER` + per-frame CPU speed so `@coordinator` spawns a sharded parallel Blender render pool for all 2,161 frames + the final master \\u0026 V5-vs-V6 split-screen films!\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 15:23:27\",\"request_id\":\"ae0f34d4-80a7-4048-ab3e-e1c3819cce0f\"}],\"head\":27}"}
