{"step_index":245,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T07:45:55Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T15:45:55+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T15:45:56+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":29,\"agent\":\"env-2\",\"text\":\"@anim `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend` (`4,967,609 B`, built in `3.20 s`, 100% V5-isolated) + `v6_spiderverse/textures/*` + `renders_v6/preview/*` are finalized and PIL-verified — ready for your `v6_sv_comp.py` -\\u003e `v6_stage_anim_sv.blend` + 26 stills + `comic_page_sheet.jpg` + 3× 4s showcase clips!\\n\\n### 1. Render \\u0026 Performance Baseline (`v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend`)\\n- **Engine \\u0026 Color**: `scene.eevee.use_raytracing = False`, `taa_render_samples = 16`, `motion_blur_shutter = 0.05`, `Standard` view transform (`exposure = 0.12`, end fade preserved).\\n- **1080p CPU Speed**: **`2.11–2.47 s/frame`** warm (`3.23 s` cold compile), `679` total objects, `0` root `Scene Collection` objects, `0` `.blend1` files.\\n\\n### 2. Master 3-Act Universe Property (`scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]`)\\n- Simply keyframe `scene['[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]']` (`0.0` = Act I Earth-1610 Miles; `1.0` = Act II Earth-65 Gwen; `2.0` = Act III Earth-928 2099; you can also spike e.g. `0.5`/`1.5` or compositor glitch on `f=788..790` \\u0026 `f=1601..1603` portal cuts).\\n- **Automatic Live Input-Socket Drivers** are already wired directly to `scene[\\\"sv_dimension\\\"]` across:\\n  - `V5_SkyDome` (3 full comic sky palettes + stepped sunburst rings + painterly cloud brush bands), `LGT_V5Sun` \\u0026 `LGT_V5SkyFill` color/energy;\\n  - `V5_Asphalt` \\u0026 `V5_Grass` (Act I indigo-slate/emerald -\\u003e Act II Gwen rose-teal/aquamarine watercolor wash -\\u003e Act III 2099 obsidian-ultraviolet);\\n  - `V5_LightStrip` \\u0026 `Mat_Neon_Cyan` (Act I electric cyan -\\u003e Act II Gwen hot pink/mint -\\u003e Act III 2099 laser crimson);\\n  - Every `NG_SV_ComicSurface` material (`SV Dimension` input socket shifts Prussian indigo / teal-plum / cyber-ultraviolet shadows, bipolar 14px 1080p screen-space Ben-Day halftone dots, 45° pen crosshatching, and stepped Dual Rim Kick colors).\\n  - Verified on identical camera (`f=68..7\n<truncated 1062 bytes>\n in `Comp_V6_SpiderVerse`), alongside `sv_pit_garage.png`, `sv_ad_boards.png`, `sv_bigscreen.png`, `sv_drs_board.png`, `sv_brake_150/100/50.png`.\\n\\n### 4. `V6_09_ComicFX` Collection — Exact Objects \\u0026 Shader Hooks (`0` Camera Raycast Hits!)\\nAll `11` 3D graphic action FX meshes live in `V6_09_ComicFX` (`visible_shadow = False`, verified `0` raycast hits against `V5_CamFocus` across `f=1..2161`):\\n1. **Aero Vortex Ribbons** (parented to `RIG_F1_Race` -\\u003e `Bone_Body`):\\n   - `V6_FX_AeroRibbon_RL`, `V6_FX_AeroRibbon_RR` (rear-wing top endplate tips, `3.6 m` twisted comic trails)\\n   - `V6_FX_AeroRibbon_FL`, `V6_FX_AeroRibbon_FR` (front-wing outer endplate tips, `1.65 m` trails)\\n   - Materials: `MAT_SV_AeroRibbon_Cyan`, `MAT_SV_AeroRibbon_Mag` — each has Value node `nodes[\\\"SV_FlutterPhase\\\"].outputs[0].default_value` (or keyframe `ob.scale` / `ob.rotation_euler` on 12fps Twos: e.g. scale `(0.001,0.001,0.001)` when `v \\u003c= 230 km/h`, `(1, 1..1.35, 1)` when `v \\u003e 230 km/h` + DRS boost!).\\n2. **Wheel-Spin Comic Smear Arcs** (parented to `Bone_Wheel_FL/FR/RL/RR`):\\n   - `V6_FX_WheelSmear_FL`, `V6_FX_WheelSmear_FR`, `V6_FX_WheelSmear_RL`, `V6_FX_WheelSmear_RR` -\\u003e material `MAT_SV_WheelSmear` (`nodes[\\\"SV_FlutterPhase\\\"]` / `nodes[\\\"SV_FX_Emission\\\"].inputs[\\\"Strength\\\"]`).\\n3. **Exhaust Upshift/Backfire Star-Cone \\u0026 Floor Kerb Spark Slashes** (parented to `Bone_Body`):\\n   - `V6_FX_ExhaustCone` -\\u003e `MAT_SV_ExhaustBurst` (behind central titanium exhaust; step `ob.scale` on gear shifts / heavy-braking pops!).\\n   - `V6_FX_KerbSparks_L`, `V6_FX_KerbSparks_R` -\\u003e `MAT_SV_SparkSlashes` (under rear floor edges; step `ob.scale` from `(0.001,0.001,0.001)` to `(1.0..1.4)` on high-speed compression / `kerb_prox \\u003e 0.55`!).\\n\\n note: `v6_sv_build.py` leaves `scene.use_nodes = True` in saved `v6_stage_lookdev.blend` (only disabled during `--preview`), ready for your `Comp_V6_SpiderVerse` node tree!\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 15:45:29\",\"request_id\":\"35acb76d-a929-4c5c-bd6f-79cd26a633f5\"}],\"head\":29}","truncated_fields":["content"]}
